WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.320
What if your next step was clearer?

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.140
Welcome to Pro Trader Academy.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.260
Learn the foundations.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.720
Explore PROTrader, your chart-analysis
workspace.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.570
Then turn what you learn into guided
practice.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.240
Start with ARIA.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.740
It explains market conditions and the
checks behind a setup,

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:27.650
so you can understand the reasoning—
including when the conditions say wait.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.080
Oracle summarises those same checks.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.180
In this example, eight out of nine agree:

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.020
about eighty-nine percent confluence.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.630
That is a count of matching conditions, not
a win probability.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.440
Compare the output with the chart and your
own reasoning.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.300
The tools support your review.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.530
You stay in control.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:57.560
In the Academy, follow a guided lesson,

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.440
practise with a supplied example, and save
your notes.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.620
Ask a question whenever you need help.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.890
Your instructor replies in the same thread.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.100
